  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(6m - 5n)² = 7\n\n30mn = 60\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n(a - b)² = a² - 2ab + b²\n\n(a + b)² = a² + 2ab + b²\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ (6m - 5n)² = 36m² - 60mn + 25n² = 7\n\n⇒ 36m² + 25n² = 7 + 60mn\n\n⇒ 30mn = 60 ⇒ mn = 2\n\n⇒ 36m² + 25n² = 7 + 60×2 = 7 + 120 = 127\n\n⇒ (6m + 5n)² = 36m² + 60mn + 25n² = 127 + 60×2 = 127 + 120 = 247\n\n⇒ (6m + 5n)² + 16mn = 247 + 16×2 = 247 + 32 = 279\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 279.**",
